<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Expediente laboral</title>
<style is:inline>
:root{
  --canvas:#f4f0e7;
  --surface:#fbf8f1;
  --ink:#13251f;
  --muted:#3d554c;
  --accent:#2f59d9;
  --orange:#ff8a54;
  --line:#d3d1c6;
  --control-line:#818477;
  --selected:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 9%,var(--surface));
  --pending:#eeeae2;
  --approved:#e2e9df;
  --observed:color-mix(in srgb,var(--orange) 30%,var(--surface));
  --danger:#84351e;
  font:15px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif;
  color:var(--ink);
  background:var(--canvas);
  accent-color:var(--accent);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}
::selection{color:var(--canvas);background:var(--accent)}
header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:28px max(5%,calc((100vw - 1200px)/2));display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:center}
header p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}h1{font-size:32px;margin:0}h2{margin:0 0 14px;font-size:20px}h3{margin:0;font-size:16px}main{max-width:1240px;margin:auto;padding:28px 20px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:260px minmax(0,1fr);gap:24px;align-items:start}
section,aside,.actions{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:20px;margin-bottom:15px}
button,.button{border:1px solid var(--control-line);background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);border-radius:7px;padding:8px 12px;font:inherit;font-weight:650;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block}
header button,button.primary{color:var(--canvas);background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink)}
button:not(:disabled):hover,.button:hover{border-color:var(--accent)}
button:disabled{color:var(--muted);background:var(--pending);border-color:var(--line);cursor:not-allowed}
aside button{width:100%;text-align:left;margin-bottom:7px}aside input{margin:8px 0 14px}.active{border-color:var(--accent);background:var(--selected)}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:12px 16px}label{display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem}
input,select,textarea{width:100%;background:var(--surface);color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--control-line);border-radius:6px;padding:8px;margin-top:4px;font:inherit}textarea{resize:vertical}
input,textarea{caret-color:var(--accent)}
input:focus,select:focus,textarea:focus,button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
details{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:10px 13px;margin-bottom:9px}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}details p{margin:8px 0;color:var(--muted)}small,.muted{color:var(--muted)}.pill{float:right;border-radius:12px;padding:1px 8px;background:var(--pending);color:var(--ink);font-size:12px}.approved{background:var(--approved)}.observed{background:var(--observed)}.file-list{padding-left:19px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}a{color:var(--accent)}
.actions{position:sticky;bottom:0;box-shadow:0 -5px 25px #13251f11}.actions p{margin:7px 0 0}.toolbar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.error{color:var(--danger)}.title-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;gap:10px}
.certificate{border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:16px;padding-top:16px}.certificate p{margin:6px 0 0}
.danger{color:var(--danger);border-color:var(--danger)}button[hidden]{display:none}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:12px}td{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:6px 9px}td:last-child{text-align:right;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}tr:last-child{background:var(--selected);font-weight:750}tr:last-child td:last-child{color:var(--accent)}
@media(max-width:760px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}header{flex-wrap:wrap}.actions{position:static}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div><p>Gestión de salida · Ecuador</p><h1>Expediente laboral</h1></div><button id="demo" type="button">Cargar datos del caso ficticio</button></header>
<main>
<aside>
  <h2>Expedientes</h2>
  <p class="muted">Los expedientes y evidencias se guardan en este navegador.</p>
  <button id="new" type="button">+ Nuevo expediente</button>
  <label>Buscar por nombre, empresa o identificación<input id="search" type="search"></label>
  <div id="records"></div>
</aside>
<form id="form" inert>
<section><div class="title-row"><h2>Datos y terminación</h2><span id="reference" class="muted"></span></div><div id="identity" class="grid"></div></section>
<section>
  <div class="title-row"><h2>Requisitos por departamento</h2><span id="progress" class="muted"></span></div>
  <p class="muted">Adjunta la evidencia y registra responsable y fecha antes de marcar cada requisito como aprobado.</p>
  <div id="checks"></div>
  <div class="certificate">
    <button type="button" class="primary" id="certificate" aria-describedby="certificate-help" disabled>Generar paz y salvo y liquidación (PDF)</button>
    <p class="muted" id="certificate-help" aria-live="polite">Guarda un expediente para comenzar.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section>
  <h2>Vacaciones y liquidación</h2>
  <p class="muted">Ingrese saldos según nómina y el período aplicable. Para varios períodos o bases variables de vacaciones, concilie el importe por período y registre ajustes en otros haberes.</p>
  <div class="grid" id="numbers"></div>
  <p><label>Detalle de cálculo, otros haberes y deducciones<textarea name="detalle" rows="3" maxlength="1500"></textarea></label></p>
  <button type="button" id="calculate">Calcular liquidación</button><div id="result" aria-live="polite"></div>
</section>
<div class="actions"><div class="toolbar"><button class="primary" id="save">Guardar expediente</button><button id="settlement" type="button" hidden>Ver liquidación PDF</button><button class="danger" id="delete-record" type="button" hidden>Eliminar expediente</button></div><p id="status" role="status"></p></div>
</form>
</main>
<script>
  import '../interfaz.js';
</script>
</body>
</html>
